@startuml
' Render with: plantuml -tsvg docs/fig_4_1_architecture.puml

title RiskIntel Architecture Overview

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #F9F9F9

actor Scheduler
node "External APIs" as APIs
component Ingestion
database "Feature Store" as FS
component "Risk Model" as Model
component "SHAP Explainer" as SHAP
component "Alerting Service" as Alert
folder Audit
component "User Dashboard" as UI

Scheduler --> Ingestion : cron
APIs --> Ingestion : fetch macro & sentiment
Ingestion --> FS : write features
FS --> Model : read features
Model --> FS : write risk scores
Model --> SHAP : predict
SHAP --> Alert : top drivers
Alert --> Audit : log decisions
Alert --> UI : notifications
FS --> UI : features & scores
Audit --> UI : decision history

legend right
Stereotypes:
- Ingestion: ETL jobs
- Feature Store: time-series table store
- Risk Model: RandomForestRegressor
- SHAP Explainer: TreeExplainer
- Alerting: rules G-01 freshness, G-02 sparse-news
endlegend

@enduml
